  "name": "Nifty Monthly IronFly Dynamic Hedge Inward Rollover",
  "description": "\n<p><strong>Nifty Monthly IronFly with Dynamic Combined Premium Hedges & Inward Rollover</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Strategy Notes & Trading Intent:</strong></p>\n<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p>1. <strong>Entry Criteria:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Underlying:</strong> NIFTY 50 Index (Monthly Expiry Spreads).</li>\n  <li><strong>Entry Window:</strong> Between 9:20 AM and 3:00 PM IST.</li>\n  <li><strong>Trigger Condition:</strong> Enters 4-leg Iron Fly (Sell ATM Call & Put, Buy Call & Put Hedges). Initial hedge gap is calculated dynamically from combined ATM Call + Put premium (HedgeGap variable). Entry time >= 9:20 AM.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2. <strong>Exit Criteria & Risk Parameters:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Target & Stop Loss:</strong> Universal Exit at 3:15 PM IST on expiry day.</li>\n  <li><strong>Universal Exit:</strong> Square off all intraday open positions at 3:15 PM IST.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>3. <strong>Additional Mechanics:</strong></p><ul><li>Call Hedge Inward Roll: When Nifty Spot crosses Call Hedge, closes Call Hedge and buys a new Call Hedge Roll_Step (100 pts) INSIDE (closer to center).</li><li>Put Hedge Inward Roll: When Nifty Spot crosses Put Hedge, closes Put Hedge and buys a new Put Hedge Roll_Step (100 pts) INSIDE.</li><li>Subsequent rolls repeat automatically for every Roll_Step move.</li></ul>\n",
  "tags": [
    {
      "label": "Pairs",
      "value": 44
    }
  ],
